# Icon Files Directory

Place your PWA icon files here:
- icon-72x72.png
- icon-96x96.png
- icon-128x128.png
- icon-144x144.png
- icon-152x152.png
- icon-192x192.png
- icon-384x384.png
- icon-512x512.png
- add-icon.png
- dashboard-icon.png
- badge-72x72.png
- checkmark.png
- xmark.png

You can generate these icons from a single source image using tools like:
- https://realfavicongenerator.net/
- https://www.pwabuilder.com/imageGenerator
